# PHASE 1: BRAINSTORMING & IDEATION

## Project Title

Import Data Using Transform Maps (Spreadsheet)

## Introduction

The project focuses on importing structured employee data from an external spreadsheet into the ServiceNow platform using Import Sets and Transform Maps.

## Problem Statement

Employee information may be received in spreadsheet format from external sources. Manually entering a large number of employee records into ServiceNow can take more time and may result in data-entry errors.

## Proposed Solution

The proposed solution is to import employee data from an Excel spreadsheet into ServiceNow. Import Sets are used as a staging area, and Transform Maps are used to map the spreadsheet fields to the appropriate fields in the Employee Test table.

## Objectives

* Import employee data from an Excel spreadsheet.
* Create a custom Employee Test table.
* Use Import Sets to load spreadsheet data.
* Use Transform Maps to transfer data to the target table.
* Prevent duplicate records using Coalesce.
* Create reports and a dashboard for employee data.

## Expected Outcome

The project should successfully import employee records into ServiceNow and provide reports and a dashboard for viewing employee information.
